This document is reviewed at least annually or upon significant organizational or regulatory change." AS content,
      "security" AS category,
      "documents/Markdown/Vulnerability_Management_Process.md" AS source,
      ["sre", "security_privacy"] AS allowed_roles
    UNION ALL
    SELECT
      "workplace-safety-policy" AS doc_id,
      "Workplace Safety Policy" AS title,
      "# Workplace Safety Policy

**Company:** Aurelius Health Systems  
**Document Type:** HR  
**Department:** Hr  
**Version:** 1.0  
**Classification:** Internal  

## Purpose
This document defines internal standards, procedures, and expectations for Aurelius Health Systems.
It is intended to support consistent operations, regulatory readiness, and secure handling of data.

## Scope
This document applies to all employees, contractors, and systems operated or managed by Aurelius Health Systems.

## Roles & Responsibilities
- Leadership ensures enforcement and governance.
- Department owners maintain and review this document annually.
- Employees are responsible for compliance.

## Policy / Procedure Details
Aurelius Health Systems follows industry best practices to ensure operational excellence.
Controls, approvals, and documentation are required where applicable.
Deviations must be documented and approved by management.

## Enforcement
Violations may result in disciplinary action up to and including termination.

## Review & Maintenance
This document is reviewed at least annually or upon significant organizational or regulatory change." AS content,
      "hr" AS category,
      "documents/Markdown/Workplace_Safety_Policy.md" AS source,
      ["viewer"] AS allowed_roles
  ),
  STRUCT(
    'RETRIEVAL_DOCUMENT' AS task_type,
    768 AS output_dimensionality
  )
);

ASSERT (
  SELECT COUNT(*) = 46
  FROM generated_documents
  WHERE status = ''
    AND ARRAY_LENGTH(embedding) = 768
) AS 'Embedding generation failed or returned unexpected dimensions';

MERGE `adk-dynatrace-observability.agent_observability.runbook_chunks` AS target
USING generated_documents AS incoming
ON target.doc_id = incoming.doc_id
WHEN MATCHED THEN
  UPDATE SET
    embedding = incoming.embedding,
    statistics = incoming.statistics,
    status = incoming.status,
    title = incoming.title,
    content = incoming.content,
    category = incoming.category,
    source = incoming.source,
    allowed_roles = incoming.allowed_roles
WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN
  INSERT (
    embedding, statistics, status, doc_id, title,
    content, category, source, allowed_roles
  )
  VALUES (
    incoming.embedding, incoming.statistics, incoming.status,
    incoming.doc_id, incoming.title, incoming.content,
    incoming.category, incoming.source, incoming.allowed_roles
  );

SELECT
  doc_id,
  title,
  allowed_roles,
  ARRAY_LENGTH(embedding) AS embedding_dimensions,
  status
FROM `adk-dynatrace-observability.agent_observability.runbook_chunks`
ORDER BY doc_id;
